    "title": "private void calculate(DealInterestAccrualQueryDTO queryDTO) {\n        Date startDate = null;\n        Date endDate = null;\n        List<String> msg = Lists.newArrayList();\n        String title = \"公司间借款计提利息异常通知:\" + queryDTO.getAccountPeriod();\n        try {\n            startDate = DateUtils.getFirstDayOfMonthMMM(queryDTO.getAccountPeriod());\n            endDate = DateUtils.getLastDayOfMonthMMM(queryDTO.getAccountPeriod());//2025 10 31\n        } catch (Exception e) {\n            log.info(\"calculateInterest exception:{}\", ExceptionUtils.getStackTrace(e));\n            throw new WebException(\"计提期间获取日期异常\");\n        }\n        List<TmsLoanReq> dealList = loanReqDAO.selectAccrualData(endDate, queryDTO.getDealCategory(),\n                queryDTO.getDealNum());\n        if (CollectionUtils.isEmpty(dealList)) {\n            throw new WebException(\"依据当前查询条件,没有满足需要计提数据,请重新发起!\");\n        }\n\n        BigDecimal interest = BigDecimal.ZERO;\n\n        for (TmsLoanReq deal : dealList) {\n            try {\n                // 获取计提的开始时间,截止到计提期间最后的时间内的最新的收到利息事件时间否则取交易生效时间\n                List<TmsLoanTrxEvent> eventList = this.getInterestEvent(deal, endDate);\n\n                if (CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(eventList)) {\n                    startDate = this.getCalculateStartDate(deal, eventList);\n                } else {\n                    startDate = deal.getPlanBeginDate();\n                }\n\n                // 具体计算利息值\n                switch (deal.getDealCategory()) {\n                    case LoanConstants.DIRECT_LOAN:\n                    case LoanConstants.ENTRUSTED_LOAN:\n                        interest = this.getInterestByDate(deal.getId(), startDate, endDate, true);\n                        break;\n                    case LoanConstants.ENTRUSTED_LOAN_POOL:\n                        interest = this.getLoanPoolInterestByDate(deal.getId(), startDate, endDate, true);\n                        break;\n                    default:\n                        throw new WebException(\"交易编号:\" + deal.getRequestNumber() + \",交易类型有误\");\n                }\n                if (BigDecimal.ZERO.compareTo(interest) == 0) {\n                    // 计提利息是0 则不生成\n                    continue;\n                }\n                // 生成计提数据\n                Date endDateNew = DateUtils.addDays(endDate, 1);\n                BigDecimal days = dealEventCashUtil.getInterestDays(startDate, endDateNew, deal.getInterestType());\n                saveOrUpdateInterest(deal, interest, queryDTO.getAccountPeriod(), startDate, endDate, days);\n\n                // 镜像交易计提数据与原始数据保持一直\n                if (!Objects.isNull(deal.getImageSourceId())) {\n                    TmsLoanReq req = loanReqDAO.selectByPrimaryKey(deal.getImageSourceId());\n                    saveOrUpdateInterest(req, interest, queryDTO.getAccountPeriod(), startDate, endDate, days);\n                }\n            } catch (Exception e) {\n                msg.add(\"借款编号:\" + deal.getRequestNumber() + \";异常信息:\" + e.getMessage());\n                log.info(\"生成公司间借款计提数据异常,交易编号:{};异常信息:{}\", deal.getRequestNumber(), ExceptionUtils.getStackTrace(e));\n            }\n        }\n        if (CollectionUtils.isNotEmpty(msg)) {\n            msgSendServiceAPI.sendMessage(title, StringUtils.join(msg.toArray(), \"\"), commonMailReceivers);\n        }\n    }\n 这个方法帮我梳理下逻辑，详细点",
